.TH "UPTERM" "1" "May 2026" "Upterm 0.0.0+dev" "Upterm Manual"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
upterm-config \- Manage upterm configuration


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBupterm config [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Manage upterm configuration file.

.PP
Config file: /build/.config/upterm/config.yaml

.PP
This follows the XDG Base Directory Specification.

.PP
Configuration priority (highest to lowest):
  1. Command-line flags
  2. Environment variables (UPTERM_ prefix)
  3. Config file
  4. Default values


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for config


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	enable debug level logging (log file: /build/.upterm/upterm.log).


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBupterm(1)\fP, \fBupterm-config-edit(1)\fP, \fBupterm-config-path(1)\fP, \fBupterm-config-view(1)\fP


